1642
00:51:05.427 --> 00:51:07.534
If I knew most of these modalities when I was a kid,

1643
00:51:07.534 --> 00:51:08.367
I would've crushed it.

1644
00:51:08.367 --> 00:51:09.200
You know?

1645
00:51:09.200 --> 00:51:11.478
Instead I was a mess in all my exams,

1646
00:51:11.478 --> 00:51:13.256
didn't come away with anything.

1647
00:51:13.256 --> 00:51:15.085
And you know, it could just be a simple practice with kids.

