1702
00:52:53.311 --> 00:52:54.144
Right.

1703
00:52:54.144 --> 00:52:55.766
And I have people working with that.

1704
00:52:55.766 --> 00:52:58.246
And that app is called his name, Eddie Stern?

1705
00:52:58.246 --> 00:52:59.079
It's just called...

1706
00:52:59.079 --> 00:52:59.912
no, it's called "Breathing App."

1707
00:52:59.912 --> 00:53:00.745
Oh, "Breathing App?"

1708
00:53:00.745 --> 00:53:02.554
So it's just "Breathing App;" it's free.

1709
00:53:02.554 --> 00:53:05.113
If you have trouble finding it, look up Eddie Stern.

1710
00:53:05.113 --> 00:53:06.157
I think it was an Ashtanga teacher

1711
00:53:06.157 --> 00:53:07.463
to like Madonna and people like that.

1712
00:53:07.463 --> 00:53:09.147
But amazing he's put a free app out there, right?

1713
00:53:09.147 --> 00:53:09.980
Yeah.

1714
00:53:09.980 --> 00:53:11.070
And so it has this disc on it,

1715
00:53:11.070 --> 00:53:13.444
so even if you are in a situation,

1716
00:53:13.444 --> 00:53:14.952
it could be a quiet coach or something

1717
00:53:14.952 --> 00:53:16.573
and you can't have the sound on,

1718
00:53:16.573 --> 00:53:19.527
you just follow that inflated ball and it closes and opens

1719
00:53:19.527 --> 00:53:21.524
and you just work with a breath to that

