00:53:21.524 --> 00:53:22.456
and it's so hypnotic.

1721
00:53:22.456 --> 00:53:24.713
I get people who are having trouble sleeping,

1722
00:53:24.713 --> 00:53:26.069
five minutes of that and they're done.

1723
00:53:26.069 --> 00:53:26.902
Right.

1724
00:53:26.902 --> 00:53:28.550
It's so quick to drop in

1725
00:53:28.550 --> 00:53:30.316
and it's a tool that you can just carry in your pocket,

1726
00:53:30.316 --> 00:53:31.149
right?

1727
00:53:31.149 --> 00:53:32.871
And then eventually it gets to the point

1728
00:53:32.871 --> 00:53:35.428
where you're just familiar with the breath,

1729
00:53:35.428 --> 00:53:38.537
like the four seconds in, six seconds out,

