it's this whole relationship with nitric oxide

1739
00:53:52.162 --> 00:53:55.088
and what that does, it's a vasodilator and bronchodilator.

1740
00:53:55.088 --> 00:53:57.284
So we know that with blood pressure

1741
00:53:57.284 --> 00:53:58.772
and how we basically absorb oxygen,

1742
00:53:58.772 --> 00:54:02.076
it's going to improve through that breath through the nose.

