And then you have these extended exhales

1747
00:54:08.613 --> 00:54:10.029
and that could be out the nose or out the mouth,

1748
00:54:10.029 --> 00:54:12.467
just (loud exhale) that's one way.

1749
00:54:12.467 --> 00:54:13.300
So that's breath.

