00:54:29.982 --> 00:54:30.815
Just 20 minutes.

1758
00:54:30.815 --> 00:54:31.648
Mm-hmm.

1759
00:54:31.648 --> 00:54:32.481
You know?

1760
00:54:32.481 --> 00:54:33.314
Equally you can get that

1761
00:54:33.314 --> 00:54:35.918
