00:54:38.590 --> 00:54:41.270
Books with nature scenes, equally,

1764
00:54:41.270 --> 00:54:42.931
they've been suggested that

1765
00:54:42.931 --> 00:54:44.439
that will lower heart rate and blood pressure.

1766
00:54:44.439 --> 00:54:45.951
So if even if it was at your desk,

