00:55:11.748 --> 00:55:12.581
Mm-hmm.

1782
00:55:12.581 --> 00:55:13.414
...opening up that panorama-

1783
00:55:13.414 --> 00:55:14.247
Mm-hmm.

1784
00:55:14.247 --> 00:55:15.080
...opening up the view,

1785
00:55:15.080 --> 00:55:16.953
that's also associated with parasympathetics.

