00:55:28.274 --> 00:55:29.107
Right.

1791
00:55:29.107 --> 00:55:29.940
...this fight and flight.

1792
00:55:29.940 --> 00:55:31.654
A wider... taking a wider gaze

1793
00:55:31.654 --> 00:55:32.487
and a softer-

1794
00:55:32.487 --> 00:55:34.012
Yeah, trying to soften your visual field-

1795
00:55:34.012 --> 00:55:34.845
Yeah.

1796
00:55:34.845 --> 00:55:35.678
...and wider.

1797
00:55:35.678 --> 00:55:36.791
And especially if you're out in nature,

1798
00:55:36.791 --> 00:55:38.043
like those guys that took those blindfolds off,

