3177
01:36:29.154 --> 01:36:29.987
Right?

3178
01:36:29.987 --> 01:36:32.475
So there's obviously emotional tiers to it, right?

3179
01:36:32.475 --> 01:36:33.475
Layer to it.

3180
01:36:33.475 --> 01:36:34.483
I would go...

3181
01:36:34.483 --> 01:36:37.786
well if we're talking about natural movement and movement,

3182
01:36:37.786 --> 01:36:39.851
what have we be just been doing for,

3183
01:36:39.851 --> 01:36:41.005
we've been here a while now, right?

3184
01:36:41.005 --> 01:36:41.838
Mm-hmm.

3185
01:36:41.838 --> 01:36:43.603
We've just been sitting, right?

3186
01:36:43.603 --> 01:36:47.587
And sitting, again, is not a natural form, right?

3187
01:36:47.587 --> 01:36:49.542
So if we just took natural movement

3188
01:36:49.542 --> 01:36:51.655
