3191
01:36:59.100 --> 01:37:00.180
those joint actions

3192
01:37:00.180 --> 01:37:03.423
and the more aligned my joint actions are,

3193
01:37:03.423 --> 01:37:05.829
the more appropriate the joint actions are,

3194
01:37:05.829 --> 01:37:09.228
the more stable that my pelvis and my lower back can be.

3195
01:37:09.228 --> 01:37:10.061
Right?

3196
01:37:10.061 --> 01:37:10.894
Yeah.

3197
01:37:10.894 --> 01:37:14.592
Every time I sit, I then compromise that, right?

3198
01:37:14.592 --> 01:37:15.425
Mm-hmm.

3199
01:37:15.425 --> 01:37:18.173
I go against the way that the joint actions,

3200
01:37:18.173 --> 01:37:20.230
every joint action, is compromised through sitting.

3201
01:37:20.230 --> 01:37:21.063
Right?

3202
01:37:21.063 --> 01:37:22.844
We talk about hip flexes and glutes.

3203
01:37:22.844 --> 01:37:23.677
Glutes-

3204
01:37:23.677 --> 01:37:24.600
the reason we have to switch our glutes on

3205
01:37:24.600 --> 01:37:26.332
is because they're so stagnant when we see it.

3206
01:37:26.332 --> 01:37:27.165
Right?

3207
01:37:27.165 --> 01:37:27.998
Whereas if you squat,

3208
01:37:27.998 --> 01:37:29.062
you don't have that relationship, right?

3209
01:37:29.062 --> 01:37:30.772
And you're always experiencing your body weight

3210
01:37:30.772 --> 01:37:33.698
in the same areas of your feet for when you stand up.

3211
01:37:33.698 --> 01:37:35.126
You could say it's an endurance event,

3212
01:37:35.126 --> 01:37:36.428
just squatting and standing,

3213
01:37:36.428 --> 01:37:37.261
right, alone.

3214
01:37:37.261 --> 01:37:40.074
Look to (indistinct) again,

3215
01:37:40.074 --> 01:37:41.338
thousands and thousands of years

3216
01:37:41.338 --> 01:37:42.875
have been living the same lifestyle.

3217
01:37:42.875 --> 01:37:45.110
They're just as sedentary as we are, right?

3218
01:37:45.110 --> 01:37:48.468
They spend 10.5 hours sitting, right?

3219
01:37:48.468 --> 01:37:49.301
They just...

3220
