4554
02:14:37.209 --> 02:14:39.709
just take your shoes and your socks off."

4555
02:14:39.709 --> 02:14:40.542
"What?"

4556
02:14:40.542 --> 02:14:42.863
And I said, "yeah, just take your shoes and socks off."

4557
02:14:42.863 --> 02:14:46.632
"Yeah, but... we're not meant to have our feet out."

4558
02:14:46.632 --> 02:14:49.680
And so that was, "well kids do need re-wilding."

4559
02:14:49.680 --> 02:14:50.513
Right?

4560
02:14:50.513 --> 02:14:52.352
Because we've basically put this on them, right?

4561
02:14:52.352 --> 02:14:53.185
Already.

4562
02:14:53.185 --> 02:14:55.485
And so once they got their shoes and socks off,

4563
02:14:55.485 --> 02:14:58.025
it was the most remarkable scene.

4564
02:14:58.025 --> 02:14:59.724
It's like embedded in me now.

4565
02:14:59.724 --> 02:15:00.655
So they...

4566
02:15:00.655 --> 02:15:01.682
shoes and socks came off

4567
02:15:01.682 --> 02:15:03.628
