4571
02:15:09.600 --> 02:15:10.505
They were doing all of that.

4572
02:15:10.505 --> 02:15:11.870
Completely freedom.

4573
02:15:11.870 --> 02:15:14.504
It's like, that's what it is.

4574
02:15:14.504 --> 02:15:15.818
That's where it's at.

4575
02:15:15.818 --> 02:15:17.230
But we've again created the,

4576
02:15:17.230 --> 02:15:18.851
"oh, I wonder what people might think of me-

4577
02:15:18.851 --> 02:15:19.789
Mm-hmm.

4578
