4585
02:15:28.050 --> 02:15:28.883
Right?

4586
02:15:28.883 --> 02:15:29.716
Get out of the way.

4587
02:15:29.716 --> 02:15:30.549
Yeah!

4588
02:15:30.549 --> 02:15:31.382
Just step out the way.

4589
02:15:31.382 --> 02:15:32.215
Mm-hmm.

4590
02:15:32.215 --> 02:15:33.048
You know?

4591
02:15:33.048 --> 02:15:33.881
Yeah.

4592
02:15:33.881 --> 02:15:34.714
Well I think that's a...

4593
02:15:34.714 --> 02:15:37.024
